  "title": "Chicken Jerusalem II",
  "description": "Chicken breasts with mushrooms and artichokes in a white wine cream sauce. This is my personal favorite. Serve with saffron rice, a green veggie of your choice, and the rest of the wine, of course! Enjoy!",
  "authors": [
